match: [Ss]plit .* across
think 1.5
say Guest checkout has four independent parts. I'll give each one to its own Subagent.
tool Bash rade spawn --agent claude --name form "Build the guest checkout form"
sh rade spawn --agent claude --name form "Build the guest checkout form" >/dev/null
out form started
tool Bash rade spawn --agent codex --name validate "Validate guest emails and addresses"
sh rade spawn --agent codex --name validate "Validate guest emails and addresses" >/dev/null
out validate started
tool Bash rade spawn --agent claude --name receipt "Write the guest receipt email"
sh rade spawn --agent claude --name receipt "Write the guest receipt email" >/dev/null
out receipt started
tool Bash rade spawn --agent codex --name tests "Write tests for guest checkout"
sh rade spawn --agent codex --name tests "Write tests for guest checkout" >/dev/null
out tests started
say Waiting for all four.
tool Bash rade wait form --until done
sh rade wait form --until done --timeout 300 >/dev/null
out form done
tool Bash rade wait receipt --until done
sh rade wait receipt --until done --timeout 300 >/dev/null
out receipt done
tool Bash rade wait validate --until done
sh rade wait validate --until done --timeout 300 >/dev/null
out validate done
tool Bash rade wait tests --until done
sh rade wait tests --until done --timeout 300 >/dev/null
out tests done
tool Bash for a in form validate receipt tests; do rade read $a --lines 20; done
out 4 reports
say All four are done:
out form      GuestForm.tsx: name, email, address, Pay
out validate  email + postcode checks, 9 cases
out receipt   guest receipt email with an order link
out tests     6 specs for guest checkout, all green
tool Bash npm test
out ✓ 23 tests passed
say Guest checkout is ready for you to look over.
done
